get=\"_blank\">Desafío BTT Fuenterrico</a></div></div><a class=\"mbr-black dropdown-item text-white text-primary\" href=\"proximamente.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Iniciativas de turismo rural</a><a class=\"mbr-black dropdown-item text-white text-primary\" href=\"proximamente.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Creación, mantenimiento de senderos</a><a class=\"mbr-black dropdown-item text-white text-primary\" href=\"proximamente.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Servicio de Route Setting</a><a class=\"mbr-black dropdown-item text-white text-primary\" href=\"boulder-las-tuerces.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Boulder en Las Tuerces, Palencia</a><a class=\"mbr-black dropdown-item text-white text-primary\" href=\"boulder-zona-centro-salamanca-caceres.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Boulder en la Zona Centro (Ávila, Cáceres y Salamanca)</a></div></li><li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link mbr-black text-white text-primary\" href=\"alquiler-material-montana.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" aria-expanded=\"false\">ALQUILER MATERIAL</a></li><li class=\"nav-item\"><a class=\"nav-link link mbr-black text-white text-primary\" href=\"blog.html\" data-app-selector=\".nav-link,.dropdown-item\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">BLOG</a></li></ul>\n\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"navbar-toggler \" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" aria-controls=\"navbarSupportedContent\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\">\n           