          "_name": "features5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features5\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/06-1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#e9f780\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-img pb-3\">\n                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-home\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>Alojamiento</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Tenemos opciones de alojamiento en la zona en PC, MP o solo alojamiento.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-img pb-3\">\n                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-hot-cup\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>Desayuno o comida</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\">¿Quieres un desayuno completo antes de comenzar la actividad o comer en un restaurante al acabar?</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-img pb-3\">\n                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-plus\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); fill: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title py-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>Combina la actividad</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Esta actividad es compatible con:\n<br>- <b><a href=\"multiactividad.html\">Multiactividad</a>\n<br>- <a href=\"escalada-en-cacere.html\">Escalada en roca</a></b><br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-img pb-3\">\n                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbri-plus\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box mbr-fonts-style\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title py-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>Combina la actividad</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Esta actividad es compatible con:<br>- Multiactividad<br>- Escalada en roca<br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
