          "_name": "content3",
          "_sourceTheme": "travelm4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"content3 travelm4_content3\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" value=\"3\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" value=\"3\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" title=\"Image\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" value=\"#ffffff\" title=\"Color\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JPe2mwq96cw\" title=\"Video\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#656565\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mbr-section-title pb-2 mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Nosotros ponemos</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">- Mono.<br>- Casco.<br>- Luz frontal.<br>- Guía titulado.<br>- Seguros de RC y accidentes.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mbr-section-title pb-2 mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Tienes que traer</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">- Ropa cómoda.<br>- Gafas de sol y crema para la aproximación<br>- Zapatillas deportivas o de montaña viejas.<br>- Ropa de cambio.<br>- Algo de comida y agua.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mbr-section-title pb-2 mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Mejor época</h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Todo el año.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
