            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "content1",
          "_sourceTheme": "travelm4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"content1 travelm4_content1\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" value=\"3\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" value=\"4\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" title=\"Image\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" value=\"#19a6fa\" title=\"Color\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JPe2mwq96cw\" title=\"Video\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#656565\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"mbr-section-title pb-3 mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">PLANNING VIAJE: El Monte Olimpo</h2>\n\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>Día 1.</b> Llegada a Tesalónica, transfer hasta Litokoro. Presentación de la Actividad \n<br>\n<br><b>Día 2. Litokoro – Refugio Spilios Agapitos  (2100m)\n</b><br>\n<br>Recorrido: 15Km<br>Desnivel positivo: 1600m<br>Desnivel negativo: 420m<br>Tiempo aprox.: 9h\n<br>\n<br><b>Día 3. Refugio Spilios Agapitos  - Mitikas (2918m) / Eskolio (2904m) - Refugio Spilios Agapitos\n</b><br>\n<br>Recorrido: 9Km<br>Desnivel positivo: 1045m<br>Desnivel negativo: 1045m<br>Tiempo aprox. : 6-7h<br><br><b>Día 4. Refugio Spilios Agapitos - Refugio Petrostrouga  (1950m)\n</b><br>\n<br>Recorrido: 10Km<br>Desnivel positivo: 990m<br>Desnivel negativo: 1070m<br>Tiempo aprox. : 5-6h\n<br>\n<br><b>Día 5. Refugio Petrostrouga - Dhion (30m) - Tesalonika\n</b><br>\n<br>Recorrido: 14 Km<br>Desnivel positivo: 100m<br>Desnivel negativo: 1770m<br>Tiempo aprox.: 6-7h<br>Fin de la travesía y transfer a Tesalónica\n<br>\n<br><b>Día 6. Tesalónica. </b>Día libre hasta la salida de nuestro vuelo de regreso<br></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content1-ko",
