                            </div>\n                            \n                        <div class=\"ico-line-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ico-line\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"rev mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".rev\">Duración:</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"rev mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".rev\">&nbsp;7 días</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n                         <div class=\"ico-line-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ico-line\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"rev mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".rev\">Info:</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"rev mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".rev\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Distancia: 114km\n</span><div><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Desnivel: 9.150 D+</span></div></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n                        <div class=\"ico-line-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ico-line\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"rev mbr-fonts-style mbr-bold\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".rev\">Descripción:\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">-</span></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n                        <div class=\"ico-line-wrap\" align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary-outline\" href=\"reservas-travesias.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Reservar</a></div>\n            \n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
